<title>UK: SOCCER-SCOTTISH PREMIER DIVISION GOALSCORERS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-SCOTTISH PREMIER DIVISION GOALSCORERS.</headline>
<dateline>GLASGOW 1996-10-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading goalscorers in the</p>
<p>Scottish premier division after Saturday's matches:</p>
<p>10 - Pierre Van Hooydonk (Celtic)</p>
<p>9 - Billy Dodds (Aberdeen), Paul Gascoigne (Rangers)</p>
<p>6 - Andreas Thom (Celtic)</p>
<p>5 - Gerry Britton (Dunfermline)</p>
<p>4 - Jorge Cadete (Celtic), Dean Windass (Aberdeen),</p>
<p>Ally McCoist (Rangers), Peter Van Vossen (Rangers),</p>
<p>Gary McSwegan (Dundee United), Paul Wright</p>
<p>(Kilmarnock)</p>
